  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogData
  sentences:
  - "Hello again, little wanderer.\nThe forest feels restless today\u2026 can you
    sense it?"
  - 'Small Slimes have been gathering near the old trees.

    They may look harmless,
    but too many of them will poison the roots.'
  - 'Will you help me?

    Bring me 10 Slime Cores, and I shall reward you with
    a gift from the forest.'
